		8, 1,	$ Data Type, Data Size
		"Input Range #0",
		"",
		"Defines type and Range of Input signal.\n\nValid Selections:\n   0 to +10 V\n   -10 to +10 V  \n\nThe Range specifies the Scaling endpoints.",
